      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This has happened at least three times since I originally started playing a few months ago. The latest time, I had about 15 friends and maybe 5 or 6 avatars I had favourited and now they're all gone.\n\nRegarding Recent Worlds, I'm unsure whether it's a bug because I don't know if 'Recent' is determined by time or is just supposed to be per-session.",
