  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-08-17T14:04:17.276Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Version: w_2019.2.5\n\nDescription:\nFriends, favourited avatars and recently visited worlds list is cleared every few days when I log in\n\nSteps to reproduce:\nJust add a friend or favourite an avatar or visit a world, log out and wait a few days then when you log back in everything will be gone.\n\nNote, friends still appear in the website (https://vrchat.net/home/) just not the actual game client.\nDon't think there's a way to check Favourited Avatars and Recent Worlds via the website.\n\nUpdate:\nJust tried logging in then out a bunch of times and one of the times my friends list showed up again. So, inconsistent results.",
